      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive groomers with isolated complaints"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers often highlight stylists like Maria, Cam, and Robbie for their patient approach and clear upfront discussions regarding grooming goals. However, a couple of dissatisfied clients criticized staff responsiveness after grooming injuries and noted rigid late pickup policies."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clean cuts and de-shedding treatments"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently praise the salon for neat haircuts, thorough de-shedding baths, and pleasant scented shampoos on both small and large breeds. While most dogs emerge looking sharp and well-groomed, two reviewers reported severe clipper irritation and skin nicks that required veterinary attention."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Comforting approach for nervous dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many dog owners appreciate that staff handle anxious, bath-averse, or giant dogs gently, often soothing them with bakery treats after appointments. Most pets appear relaxed and excited during drop-off, though one customer felt their injured pet was mishandled during a shave."
      }
    }
  ],
